wizard-hint-company = Your company's name, a notice and a logo. They print in the title block of every page of a new project.
wizard-hint-frame = The border and title block of new schematic pages. The cover page and the section divider pages keep their own borders.
wizard-hint-colour = Which wire colour belongs to which voltage and function. The wire list takes its colours from it, and the cover page prints it as a table.
wizard-hint-size = The cross section a wire gets when the drawing does not give it one: one size for control circuits, one for mains circuits. The cover page prints them as a table.
wizard-hint-numbering = How devices and terminal strips get their names, and how a cross reference points to the place of a contact. A format is built from the codes listed under Result; other characters print as typed.
wizard-hint-structure = The structure nodes and the sections a new project starts with. A section is a range of page numbers that opens with a divider page; type one per line: number, first-last page, title.
wizard-hint-revisions = The label of a new project's first revision, in the form V1.0. It prints in the title block's revision cell.
wizard-hint-languages = The language of the texts in the drawings, and how dates and numbers print in the title block and the lists.
wizard-hint-reports = The lists and overviews a new project makes by itself, each on its own pages, and how strictly the drawings are checked before they go out.
wizard-hint-review = Check your choices, then create the template.
wizard-later = You can change this later in the template: Templates…, then Edit. A project made earlier keeps what it started with.
wizard-later-colour = You can change this later in a project: Project ▸ Setup ▸ Project properties, row Colour profile.
wizard-later-size = You can change this later in a project: Project ▸ Setup ▸ Project properties, row Size profile.
wizard-later-numbering = You can change this later in a project: Project ▸ Setup ▸ Project properties, rows Numbering and Xref format.
wizard-later-structure = In a project, Project ▸ Setup ▸ Structure node… adds more nodes; New section… and Edit section… (the Pages list, Project properties) add and change sections.
wizard-later-revisions = This is set only here: a project made from the template starts with this label.
wizard-later-reports = In a project, Output ▸ Reports ▸ Report block… adds a report page, and Project ▸ Setup ▸ Check level… changes the check level.
wizard-later-review = To change the template later, open Templates… on the start page and press Edit. A new template's texts print readably; their heights and typefaces are in Project ▸ Text styles….
